  "description": "After thirteen years as a loyal employee of the Soonyang Group, South Korea’s largest business empire, Hyeon-U is rewarded with betrayal–and murdered–by his employers! Miraculously, he’s given a second chance, reborn back in time as Dojun Jin, grandson of the founder of the corporate dynasty that betrayed him. In a daring quest to rewrite destiny, he will not only attempt to settle the score; he will aim for the ultimate hostile takeover. \n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment, edited)",
